---
// Timeline: Kubernetes Linux CFS CPU quota throttling when GOMAXPROCS mismatches pod limits.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 330;
---
<figure class="gpk8">
  <div class="gpk8-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparison over a 100 ms Linux CFS quota period for a Kubernetes pod capped at 4 CPUs (400 ms budget) on an 8-core host: GOMAXPROCS=8 exhausts 400 ms across 8 threads in 50 ms and gets throttled for the next 50 ms (300% latency spike), whereas GOMAXPROCS=4 runs smoothly across the full 100 ms period.">
      {/* Top: Throttled */}
      <text x="20" y="26" class="gpk8-h-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Host-sized GOMAXPROCS=8 on a 4-CPU Pod limit (400 ms quota per 100 ms period)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. GOMAXPROCS=8 lấy theo máy chủ trên Pod giới hạn 4 CPU (hạn mức 400 ms mỗi chu kỳ 100 ms)</tspan>
      </text>

      <DiagramIcon name="kubernetes" x={20} y={76} size={22} />
      <text x="50" y="81" class="gpk8-b">8 threads</text>

      <rect x="130" y="48" width="370" height="62" rx="6" class="gpk8-burn" />
      <text x="315" y="75" text-anchor="middle" class="gpk8-b">0–50 ms: 8 threads × 50 ms = 400 ms BURNED</text>
      <text x="315" y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="gpk8-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Entire 100 ms cgroup budget exhausted in 50 ms!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đốt sạch quota 100 ms chỉ trong nửa đầu 50 ms!</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="504" y="48" width="380" height="62" rx="6" class="gpk8-stall" />
      <text x="694" y="75" text-anchor="middle" class="gpk8-b-red">50–100 ms: THROTTLED (0 CPU allocated)</text>
      <text x="694" y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="gpk8-b-red-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>50 ms request stalls to 150 ms (+300% latency!)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Request 50 ms bị đóng băng thành 150 ms (vọt p99!)</tspan>
      </text>

      <line x1="130" x2="884" y1="126" y2="126" class="gpk8-axis" />
      <text x="130" y="142" class="gpk8-sm">0 ms</text>
      <text x="500" y="142" text-anchor="middle" class="gpk8-b-red">50 ms (quota = 0)</text>
      <text x="884" y="142" text-anchor="end" class="gpk8-sm">100 ms (next period)</text>

      <line x1="16" x2={W - 16} y1="166" y2="166" class="gpk8-rule" />

      {/* Bottom: Container-aware */}
      <text x="16" y="196" class="gpk8-h-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Container-aware GOMAXPROCS=4 (Go 1.25+ built-in or uber-go/automaxprocs)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. GOMAXPROCS=4 khớp giới hạn cgroup (tích hợp sẵn từ Go 1.25+ hoặc uber-go/automaxprocs)</tspan>
      </text>

      <DiagramIcon name="docker" x={16} y={244} size={22} />
      <text x="46" y="249" class="gpk8-b">4 threads</text>

      <rect x="130" y="216" width="754" height="62" rx="6" class="gpk8-smooth" />
      <text x="507" y="243" text-anchor="middle" class="gpk8-ok">0–100 ms: 4 threads × 100 ms = 400 ms — steady execution, 0 ms throttled</text>
      <text x="507" y="264" text-anchor="middle" class="gpk8-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Tail latency stays flat · Fewer OS context switches</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Độ trễ đuôi p99 ổn định · Ít context switch thừa giữa các thread</tspan>
      </text>

      <line x1="130" x2="884" y1="294" y2="294" class="gpk8-axis" />
      <text x="130" y="310" class="gpk8-sm">0 ms</text>
      <text x="507" y="310" text-anchor="middle" class="gpk8-ok">50 ms (no freeze)</text>
      <text x="884" y="310" text-anchor="end" class="gpk8-sm">100 ms</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Linux CFS enforces container CPU limits over 100 ms windows. When GOMAXPROCS exceeds the Pod's CPU quota, busy threads burn the entire window's budget early and get frozen until the next period.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Linux CFS kiểm soát hạn mức CPU của container theo từng chu kỳ 100 ms. Khi GOMAXPROCS vượt quá giới hạn CPU của Pod, các thread đốt sạch hạn mức chỉ trong vài chục mili giây đầu rồi bị treo cứng chờ sang chu kỳ kế tiếp.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gpk8 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gpk8-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gpk8 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gpk8 text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gpk8-h-red { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gpk8-h-ok { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gpk8-h-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gpk8-burn { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gpk8-stall { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-dasharray: 5 3; }
  .gpk8-smooth { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gpk8-smooth { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gpk8-axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gpk8-rule { stroke: var(--border); }
  .gpk8-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gpk8-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gpk8-b-red-sm { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gpk8-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gpk8-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gpk8-sm { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gpk8 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
